text.section:
The following production areas of flue-cured tobacco are designated for the purposes of this chapter:
			Area I: Franklin, Henry, Patrick, and Pittsylvania Counties;
			Area II: Appomattox, Campbell, Charlotte, Halifax, and Prince Edward Counties;
			Area III: Mecklenburg County;
			Area IV: Brunswick and Greensville Counties; and
			Area V: Amelia, Dinwiddie, Lunenburg, Prince George, Nottoway, and Sussex Counties.
